<title>USA: USDA -- CCC crop loan interest rates dip in June.</title>
<headline>USDA -- CCC crop loan interest rates dip in June.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said interest rates for Commodity Credit Corp loans made during June would be 6.875 percent for 1996 crops and 5.875 percent for 1995 and earlier crops, down 0.125 percent from May's rates.</p>
</text>
